e during the year, ending as The McCaffrican Americans."},{"season":"2024","heading":"2024: Clandestine Ball Busters","text":"Under Joe and Tanner, Clandestine Ball Busters went 5-9 to finish as the No. 11 seed, scoring 1699.20 points, 10th in the league. [[p:9509|Bijan Robinson]] led the club with 295.90 points in 15 starts, followed by [[p:11632|Malik Nabers]] (232.00). The season high was 157.28 in week 17 ([[g:2024-17-7-9]]). In the Toilet Bowl they lost to [[f:11|BubbaNASTIES]] 138.98-172.20 in the Toilet Bowl Semifinal, then beat [[f:7|young sexy central]] 157.28-146.10 in the Toilet Bowl Final and finished 11th. The front office made 33 transactions, 3 of them trades. Young Sexy Award winners on the roster at season's end: Bucky Irving (RB). The club was renamed 2 times during the year, ending as Clandestine Ball Busters."},{"season":"2025","heading":"2025: Clandestine Ball Busters","text":"Under Joe and Tanner, Clandestine Ball Busters went 9-5 to finish as the No. 5 seed, scoring 1822.35 points, 7th in the league. Their all-play record of 82-72 suggests a team that was worse than its record; schedule luck was worth 1.55 wins for them. [[p:9509|Bijan Robinson]] led the club with 323.60 points in 15 starts, followed by [[p:4046|Patrick Mahomes]] (287.18). The season high was 166.60 in week 6 ([[g:2025-06-6-9]]). In the Dynasty Playoffs they lost to [[f:1|Mojo Dojo Casa Team]] 151.56-190.18 in the First Round, then lost to [[f:6|got that DAWG]] 154.70-155.24 in the Fifth Place Game and finished 6th. The front office made 33 transactions, 13 of them trades."},{"season":"2026","heading":"2026: Clandestine Ball Busters","text":"Through 4 games under Joe and Tanner, Clandestine Ball Busters are 2-2 and 5th in the standings, with 546.40 points (7th). [[p:9509|Bijan Robinson]] led the club with 113.90 points in 4 starts, followed by [[p:8144|Chris Olave]] (90.10). The season high was 165.26 in week 1 ([[g:2026-01-2-9]]). The front office made 20 transactions, 3 of them trades."}],"moves":[{"season":"2023","trades":4,"claims":3,"signings":10,"adds":13,"releases":13,"gs":65,"pts":555.8},{"season":"2024","trades":3,"claims":5,"signings":14,"adds":19,"releases":24,"gs":54,"pts":445.0},{"season":"2025","trades":13,"claims":7,"signings":8,"adds":15,"releases":18,"gs":21,"pts":151.56},{"season":"2026","trades":3,"claims":5,"signings":9,"adds":14,"releases":14,"gs":6,"pts":27.4}]}